WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.414 --> 00:00:03.417
A site folder (index.html, guides/, faq.html, css/, js/) zipped as site.zip

2
00:00:03.417 --> 00:00:05.569
Drop site.zip on markdrop.in/upload

3
00:00:05.569 --> 00:00:08.818
Markdrop recognises it as a multi-page site

4
00:00:08.818 --> 00:00:15.762
Give it a title and a link

5
00:00:15.762 --> 00:00:20.393
Publish: Markdrop unpacks it and opens index.html

6
00:00:20.393 --> 00:00:31.170
Links between the pages work, like on any website
